@startuml lte-radio-common
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title LTE Radio/RAN: общая схема применения QoS

actor "UE\nUser Equipment\nсмартфон/модем" as UE
node "eNodeB\nLTE base station" as ENB {
  rectangle "RRC Admission Control\nдопуск UE/bearer" as RRC
  rectangle "PDCP/RLC queues\nочереди DRB" as RLC
  rectangle "MAC Scheduler\nвыдача PRB и UL grants" as MAC
  rectangle "PHY/RF\nMCS, HARQ, MIMO" as PHY
}
node "EPC" as EPC {
  rectangle "MME\ncontrol plane" as MME
  rectangle "S-GW\nuser plane anchor" as SGW
  rectangle "P-GW/PCEF\nbearer QoS rules" as PGW
  database "HSS\nsubscriber profile" as HSS
  database "PCRF\nPCC policy" as PCRF
}
cloud "Internet / IMS / Enterprise APN" as DN

UE <--> PHY : LTE-Uu radio
PHY --> MAC
MAC --> RLC
RLC --> RRC
ENB --> MME : S1-MME\nNAS/RRC context
ENB --> SGW : S1-U\nGTP-U bearers
SGW --> PGW : S5/S8\nGTP-U
PGW --> DN : SGi
MME --> HSS : S6a
PGW <--> PCRF : Gx\nQCI/ARP/GBR/AMBR
PCRF --> ENB : policy reaches RAN\nvia bearer setup

note right of MAC
Здесь политика становится радио-действием:
QCI priority, GBR debt, delay budget,
scheduler weight and CQI/fairness.
ARP/pre-emption применяется на admission/retention,
а не как per-packet scheduler priority.
end note
@enduml
